/P 262 0 R
/E (The campaign reflects the government's commitment to addressing the growing issue of substance abuse, which poses significant social, economic, and health challenges to the country. Through interactive sessions, expert talks, and engaging activities, we strive to empower children with knowledge and skills to make informed choices, fostering a secure and nurturing environment for their growth and development. Together, we can create a brighter, addiction-free future for our young generation.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [12]
>>
