/E (On 13th August 2024, Government Engineering College, Patan, observed AntiRagging Day, organized by the NSS unit to foster a harmonious, ragging-free environment for students, particularly the new entrants. The event, held in the presence of the principal, faculty, and newly admitted students, began at 11:00 am with the melodious NSS song, followed by a warm welcome to the chief guest. The chief guest addressed the gathering, discussing the negative impact of ragging on student life and offering preventive measures to ensure a safe and supportive campus environment.)
