/P 264 0 R
/E (In Week 1, volunteers cleaned the main campus, focusing on pathways, administrative blocks, and nonbiodegradable waste while raising awareness among students and faculty. Week 2 emphasized cleaning classrooms, laboratories, and department surroundings, ensuring hygienic learning spaces. Week 3 targeted the New Amenity Block, canteen, seminar halls, and outdoor areas, promoting environmental protection by maintaining greenery and proper waste disposal. Finally, Week 4 revisited the campus to ensure sustained cleanliness, motivating staff and students to uphold hygiene practices. The campaign successfully fostered a lasting culture of cleanliness and environmental responsibility within the campus community.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
711 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
