/Title (The event was organized at Electrical Seminar Hall, GEC Patan. The event commenced at 11 a.m. First, we welcomed our all guest with flower bouquet. The event started by deep pragtya, with a soulful rendition of NSS song. Afterwards, our District Officer Nilesh Desai and our professor gave the speech on Nasha Mukti Bharat Abhiyan. Then we pledged to uphold the cause of nasha mukti, dedicating ourselves to creating a society free from the grip of addiction. The event concluded by the resonation of National Anthem.)
